@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
hide stereotype

actor "用户" as User
component "Fcitx / Windows 前端" as Frontend
component "voimed\ndaemon" as Daemon
component "voime-core\nCPU pipeline\nCPU ORT" as Core
component "SenseVoice\n常驻 Preview\n+ CPU Final" as SenseVoice
component "voime-gpu-firered\n可选 Final" as FireRedWorker
component "OpenASR / FireRed\nAED + Punc" as FireRedModel
component "voime-gpu-qwen3\n可选 Final" as QwenWorker
component "llama.cpp / Qwen\nASR + mmproj" as QwenModel

database "models/active" as Active
folder "模型包" as Packages {
  artifact "sense-voice-2024-int8\n+ VAD" as SvPackage
  artifact "fire-red-aed-fp16\n+ FireRedPunc" as FireRedPackage
  artifact "qwen3-asr-1.7b-fp16\n+ mmproj" as QwenPackage
}

User --> Frontend
Frontend --> Daemon : IPC
Daemon --> Active : 解析 Final 包
Active --> Packages
Daemon --> Core : PCM / 分段
Core --> SenseVoice : Preview + CPU Final
Daemon --> FireRedWorker : Final = FireRed\n按 kind 硬编码
Daemon --> QwenWorker : Final = Qwen\n按 kind 硬编码
FireRedWorker --> FireRedModel
QwenWorker --> QwenModel
FireRedWorker --> Daemon : Final 文本（已加标点）
QwenWorker --> Daemon : Final 文本（内置标点）
Daemon --> Frontend : Partial / Final

note right of Daemon
  Preview 固定 SenseVoice；
  GPU 只替换 Final；
  两个 worker 不会同时运行
end note
@enduml
